  "question": {
    "text": "For complete combustion of ethene,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br />the amount of heat produced as measured in bomb calorimeter is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1406</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>. The minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T&#916;S</mi></math> needed to reach equilibrium is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>)</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kJ</mi></math>. (Nearest integer)<br />Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1411",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1406</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#916;n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mi>RT</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;U</mi></math> is the change in the internal energy of the system, which is the sum of the kinetic and potential energies of all the molecules in the system. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> is the gas constant (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>/</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> is the temperature in Kelvin.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1406</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1406</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1410</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8776;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1411</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>The</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>minimum</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>value</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>at</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>equilibrium</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1411</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
